{"id":"ecopista-do-dao","title":"Ecopista do Dão","who":"Classic route · Portugal's railway path, family-friendly","when":"All year (spring and autumn best)","vehicle":"Any bike, 1–2 days","kind":"bike","color":"#16a34a","summary":"About 49 km of paved path on the old Dão railway line between Viseu, Tondela and Santa Comba Dão, opened in 2011: gentle gradients, pine woods and vineyards, old stations, and colour-coded surfaces by municipality. It now links with the Ecopista do Vouga for 114 km without traffic.","sources":[{"label":"e-konomista: ecopistas em Portugal para pedalar em família","url":"https://www.e-konomista.pt/ecopistas-portugal-pedalar-em-familia/"},{"label":"Echoboomer: Ecopista do Vouga inaugurada, ligação ao Dão","url":"https://echoboomer.pt/ecopista-do-vouga-foi-inaugurada"}],"approximate":"The old railway stations along the path.","km":57,"bbox":[-8.1302,40.396,-7.9139,40.6673],"stops":[{"name":"Viseu","place":"Viseu, Portugal","at":[40.6575,-7.9139],"text":"A granite cathedral town and the north end (red path).","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/S%C3%A9_de_Viseu_IMG_20141226_155323-Pano_%2836162491774%29.jpg/500px-S%C3%A9_de_Viseu_IMG_20141226_155323-Pano_%2836162491774%29.jpg","page":"Viseu","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:S%C3%A9_de_Viseu_IMG_20141226_155323-Pano_%2836162491774%29.jpg","credit":"nborges from Portugal","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Torredeita","place":"Torredeita, Viseu","at":[40.6441,-8.0153],"text":"Through pine woods on a gentle gradient.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/S%C3%A9_de_Viseu_IMG_20141226_155323-Pano_%2836162491774%29.jpg/500px-S%C3%A9_de_Viseu_IMG_20141226_155323-Pano_%2836162491774%29.jpg","page":"Viseu","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:S%C3%A9_de_Viseu_IMG_20141226_155323-Pano_%2836162491774%29.jpg","credit":"nborges from Portugal","license":"CC BY 2.0"}},{"name":"Tondela","place":"Tondela, Po